WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.880
Let's look back at Taylor Swift's journey.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.740
Are you ready for it?

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:09.800
Taylor won her first AMA in 2008 and
performed for the first time at the

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:14.840
show singing White Horse, sending the
prince a message: you're too late,

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.640
turn that white horse around and get lost.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:21.880
In 2009, she won in 3 categories,
including Artist of the Year for the

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:27.380
first time. From then on, she
just spoke up... or, in Swift,

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.720
Speak Now. Award after
award in 2010, '11 and '12.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:35.400
By 2013, with Red, she had
already racked up 14 AMAs.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:40.800
In 2014, we went to 1989, we went to

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:45.920
1989. We got that unforgettable
Blank Space performance.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:48.760
Tay-Tay also took Artist of
the Year to close the night.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:54.360
In 2018, our blonde was back with
the Reputation era, and set a record.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:58.400
Taylor became the female artist with
the most AMAs in the show's history.

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:03.960
In 2019, she was honored as
Artist of the Decade and, despite

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.339
being in her Lover era, she
sent a message to a hater,

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:12.560
Scooter Braun. She simply wore
an outfit with the names of all

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:15.360
her albums that were under
the manager's control.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:18.760
Fearless. Haters gonna hate,
hate, hate, hate, hate.

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:24.240
In 2020 she won 4, in 2021 3
more with Evermore, for a total

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:29.760
of an insane 34 trophies, 6 of them
for Artist of the Year, a category

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:31.999
where she also holds the record for wins.

00:01:32.039 --> 00:01:36.339
In 2022, Taylor is
nominated in 6 categories.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:41.240
Will she take them all by
midnight tonight, or is that just

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:45.299
folklore, huh? Taylor will have to
leave a blank space on the shelf.
